# Firebase iOS Configuration

To connect the Sample app to real Firebase Remote Config:

1. Create a project in [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/).
2. Add an iOS App with Bundle ID `com.kit.abtesting.demo`.
3. Download `GoogleService-Info.plist` and add it to the `Sample/` directory.
4. In `SampleApp.swift`, uncomment Firebase initialization:
   ```swift
   import FirebaseCore
   import AbTestingFirebase

   // Inside SampleApp.init()
   FirebaseApp.configure()
   ```
5. Relaunch the demo app. It will detect `isFirebaseInitialized()` and automatically install `FirebaseAbTestingProvider`.
